The sunshine is very bright this morning.
Now it is quite hot in Mumbai.
I get ready for the office.
Today I wear my new blue kurta.
This cotton kurta is very nice.
It is not thick at all.
The fabric is very soft and light.
I come out of my building.
I walk to the BEST bus stop.
There is very bright sunshine outside.
But I do not feel too hot today.
In this blue kurta, I feel very fresh.
This new kurta is perfect for me.
On the way, some other people are also wearing cotton clothes.
I wait for my bus at the bus stop.
In a little while, my red bus arrives.
I comfortably board the bus.
I am completely ready for this warm weather.
My commute today is very good.
